{
  "_comment": [
    "Synthetic organization used by the pytest suite and by `python main.py --demo`.",
    "MOCKED ON PURPOSE: the task brief allows mocking any part of the API that is",
    "impractical to reach, and private Dependabot advisories are exactly that - they",
    "require an org with paid security features and real vulnerable dependencies.",
    "Every field below matches the shape of the real API response the scanner parses,",
    "so the same code path runs against fixtures and against api.github.com.",
    "`as_of` pins the clock, which makes demo output byte-for-byte reproducible: the",
    "same command run next month still prints the same scores."
